  "text": "Our Partners - SAACA\nSkip to content\nHome\nShop\nOur Partners\nOur Lifelong Members\nOur Mrs South Africa\nEvents\nDonate\nContact Us\nHome\nShop\nOur Partners\nOur Lifelong Members\nOur Mrs South Africa\nEvents\nDonate\nContact Us\nR\n0,00\n0\nCart\nR\n0,00\n0\nCart\nHome\nShop\nOur Partners\nOur Lifelong Members\nOur Mrs South Africa\nEvents\nDonate\nContact Us\nHome\nShop\nOur Partners\nOur Lifelong Members\nOur Mrs South Africa\nEvents\nDonate\nContact Us\nProducts search\nSAACA's Esteemed Partners\nMrs South Africa\nSAACA is proud to be an official charity partner, with an ambassador supporting our events each year.\nwww.mrssouthafrica.co.za\nHannons Hair Care\nEvery relaxer shampoo sold gives back, with a portion going straight to SAACA’s mission.\nwww.hannons.co.za\nLiz Meiring\nOur patron, championing SAACA through events and powerful promotional campaigns.\n082 456 1184\nEco Vet\nSupplying trusted products at cost, helping SAACA support more pets in need.\nwww.ecovet.co.za\nDotsure Pet Insurance\nEvery approved quote brings a donation to SAACA — protection that gives back.\nwww.dotsure.co.za\nBiofarms\nProviding Nutribites, ProBone, and more at cost, so SAACA can share wellness wider.\nwww.biofarmcc.co.za\nArrie Nel Apteek Groep\nHosting in-store donation stations, making it easy to support SAACA while you shop.\nwww.arrienel.co.za\nHond Lekker Koffie\nBrewing good with every cup, a lekker way to back SAACA’s work.\nhttps://hondlekkerkoffie.company.site/\nUBUNTU VISIONS\nwe are more than a nonprofit, we are a movement for collective action, community empowerment and sustainable transformation.\nhttps://www.ubuntu-visions.com/\nThea van Schalkwyk\nGift packaging with heart, making SAACA’s support feel even more special.\n083 456 7064\nErne du Plessis\nCreative force behind SAACA’s social media, helping our message reach further.\n078 825 1261\nTaking Brands Online\nBuilding websites, managing platforms, and driving marketing expertise for SAACA.\nwww.takingbrandsonline.com\nSAVF\nServices\nShop online\nFunding\nDonate\nEvents\nWhy Support SAACA\nGet In Touch\nEmail: bark@saaca.org.za\nPhone: +27 83 268 8701\nHours: Mon-Fri 9:00AM - 5:00PM\nFacebook-f\n©2026 All Rights Reserved | Site developed and mainted by Taking Brands Online",
